      "chapter": "Jaw: support and retention",
      "duration_ms": 1800,
      "note": "The jaw rides on the flat base between two rails. A round chamber accepts the rotating screw head. A separate U keeper drops into a transverse slot behind the head; the main forward thrust is carried by the broad front shoulder."
